class Solution {
    public String convertToTitle(int columnNumber) {
        StringBuilder ans=new StringBuilder();

    while(columnNumber>0){
        columnNumber--;
        int num1=columnNumber%26;
        char ch = (char)('A' + num1);
        ans.append(ch);
        columnNumber=columnNumber/26;

    }
          return ans.reverse().toString();
    }


}
logic:
1. We initialize an empty StringBuilder to build the resulting string.
2. We use a while loop that continues until columnNumber becomes 0.
3. Inside the loop, we decrement columnNumber by 1 to adjust for 0-based
    indexing.